{'symbol': 'JBHT', 'date': '2022-04-18 16:05:00', 'title': 'J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES, INC. REPORTS U.S. GAAP REVENUES, NET EARNINGS AND EARNINGS PER SHARE FOR THE FIRST QUARTER 2022', 'text': 'LOWELL, ARK.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES, INC. (NASDAQ: JBHT) ANNOUNCED FIRST QUARTER 2022 U.S. GAAP (UNITED STATES GENERALLY ACCEPTED ACCOUNTING PRINCIPLES) NET EARNINGS OF $243.3 MILLION, OR DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $2.29 VERSUS FIRST QUARTER 2021 NET EARNINGS OF $146.6 MILLION, OR $1.37 PER DILUTED SHARE. TOTAL OPERATING REVENUE FOR THE CURRENT QUARTER WAS $3.49 BILLION COMPARED WITH $2.62 BILLION FOR THE FIRST QUARTER 2021. ALL SEGMENTS CONTRIBUTED TO THE YEAR-OVER-Y'}